 coords 0 0 0
 m_bRespawnEnabled 0
 m_bWaveRespawn 0
 m_bRallyPointsEnabled 0
 m_iTimeToRespawn 60
 m_iRespawnCutoffMinutes 0
 m_eRespawnMode 0
 m_iTimeLimitMinutes 60
 m_bLockUnusedSlots 1
 m_bUseSafestartTimeLimit 1
 m_iSafestartTimeLimit 15
 m_bUseCVON 1
 m_aMissionDescriptors {
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{6B1109E1A503377C}" {
   m_sTitle "Mission: Situation"
   m_sTextData "Kolguyev, east coast, 0700. Overcast, calm sea."\
   ""\
   "The beach between Gorshkovo and the naval harbour is the only stretch of open shore on this coast. The Germans have wired it, salted the waterline with hedgehogs and dug in on the bluff above. Behind the beach the ground climbs past the mining village of Gorshkovo and its coal silo to the Nadezhda coal mine on the ridge, 1.2 km inland and 200 m up."\
   ""\
   "US infantry are loading into LCVPs at a staging pontoon 850 m offshore."\
   ""\
   "BLUFOR: US Army rifle platoon (1PLT, 1-1 to 1-4, WPNS). Seven LCVPs."\
   "OPFOR: German infantry platoon (ZUG, GRUPPE 1-3, MG-TRUPP). Dug in, no vehicles."
   m_aFactionKeys {
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{6B1109E1F61769E7}" {
   m_sTitle "BLUFOR Briefing"
   m_sTextData "MISSION"\
   "Destroy the six MCOMs, two per zone. Plant a charge (5 s) on an active MCOM and keep the Germans off it until it blows (45 s). When both MCOMs of a zone are gone, the next zone opens."\
   ""\
   "ZONES"\
   "1. Beach exits: A at the south draw above the fishermen's huts, B at the harbour road at the north end of the beach."\
   "2. Gorshkovo: C in the courtyard of the apartment blocks, D at the coal silo north of the village."\
   "3. Nadezhda mine: E at the conveyor head, F next to the mine shaft on the ridge."\
   ""\
   "EXECUTION"\
   "Each element spawns on the pontoon next to its own LCVP: step down into the boat, the squad lead or a volunteer drives. Land anywhere on BEACH RED (marked); the old dragon's teeth and the hedgehogs give some cover, the wire above the beach has gaps. A spare LCVP waits at the north end of the pontoon."\
   "After safe start the run in takes about two minutes. Mind the rock awash 130 m off the middle of the beach."\
   ""\
   "When zone 1 falls your spawn moves ashore to the beachhead; when zone 2 falls, to the silo road below the mine."
   m_aFactionKeys {
    "BLUFOR"
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{6B1109E199D38E4F}" {
   m_sTitle "OPFOR Briefing"
   m_sTextData "MISSION"\
   "Hold the MCOMs. The Americans will come from the sea. Defuse a planted charge (7 s) before it blows (45 s)."\
   ""\
   "ZONES"\
   "1. Beach exits: A at the south draw above the fishermen's huts, B at the harbour road at the north end of the beach."\
   "2. Gorshkovo: C in the courtyard of the apartment blocks, D at the coal silo north of the village."\
   "3. Nadezhda mine: E at the conveyor head, F next to the mine shaft on the ridge."\
   ""\
   "EXECUTION"\
   "You start on the bluff above the beach. When a zone falls, fall back: your spawn moves to the hill west of Gorshkovo, then to the road behind the mine."\
   "You have no vehicles. Each Gruppe's anti-tank rifleman carries HEAT rifle grenades and bundle charges: use them on the boats."\
   ""\
   "YOU WIN if any MCOM survives the time limit (60 minutes) or the Americans are wiped out."
   m_aFactionKeys {
    "OPFOR"
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
  COA_MissionDescriptor "{6B1109E10A6C267B}" {
   m_sTitle "Administration"
   m_sTextData "Rush, 3 zones x 2 MCOMs. Time limit 60 minutes after safe start (safe start max. 15 minutes)."\
   ""\
   "No timed respawns. When a zone falls, every dead player of both sides respawns at their side's new spawn."\
   ""\
   "LCVPs: 7 at the staging pontoon (one per BLUFOR element + 1 spare). A destroyed LCVP is respawned at the pontoon for free when the next zone falls; intact boats (beached or adrift) stay where they are. Nothing else respawns."\
   ""\
   "Mission by tanaKa-."
   m_aFactionKeys {
    "BLUFOR"
    "OPFOR"
   }
   m_bShowForAnyFaction 0
  }
 }
 m_iFactionOneRatio 3
